{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/f0f0f2ed-bdcc-441d-8cb6-9e422a0adece\";\nconst img = `${assetPathPrefix}/83ac5.svg`;\nconst img1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/c4e1e.svg`;\nconst img2 = `${assetPathPrefix}/a5de6.svg`;\nconst imgSubtract = `${assetPathPrefix}/aa689.svg`;\nconst img282 = `${assetPathPrefix}/9ea92.svg`;\nconst img3 = `${assetPathPrefix}/812ed.svg`;\nconst img283 = `${assetPathPrefix}/435d8.svg`;\n\nfunction NavStores({ className }: { className?: string }) {\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"bg-white h-[60px] relative w-[390px]\"} data-node-id=\"336:783\" data-name=\"САДОХОД / nav / stores\">\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[52.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:784\" data-name=\"Магазины\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[169.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:789\" data-name=\"Камера\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img1} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[286.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:792\" data-name=\"Профиль\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img2} />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function Component19() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#f0efeb] relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"407:442\" data-name=\"19 · Перенести товары\">\n      <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute h-[100px] left-[calc(50%-0.21px)] top-0 w-[397.572px]\" data-node-id=\"407:455\" data-name=\"Subtract\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgSubtract} />\n      </div>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer left-[18px] size-[42px] top-[53px]\" data-node-id=\"407:483\" data-name=\"PROTO / Назад\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[12px] not-italic text-[30px] text-black text-left top-0 whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"407:484\">\n          ‹\n        </p>\n      </a>\n      <NavStores className=\"absolute bg-white h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[390px]\" />\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[16px] text-center top-[67px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:504\">\n        перенести товары\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[13px] top-[181px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:506\">\n        Выбрано 4 товара\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[13px] top-[220px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:507\">\n        Из магазина\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[59px] left-[30px] rounded-[6px] top-[244px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:508\" data-name=\"Исходный магазин\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[50px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[16px] top-[264px] w-[270px]\" data-node-id=\"407:509\">\n        Б-2В-81\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[13px] top-[333px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:510\">\n        В магазин\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[30px] rounded-[6px] top-[359px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:511\" data-name=\"Магазин / Б-2В-82\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[50px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[15px] top-[377px] w-[200px]\" data-node-id=\"407:512\">\n        Б-2В-82\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[319px] size-[19px] top-[377px]\" data-node-id=\"407:513\" data-name=\"Выбор / Б-2В-82\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img282} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[325px] size-[7px] top-[383px]\" data-node-id=\"407:514\" data-name=\"Выбран\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img3} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[30px] rounded-[6px] top-[425px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:515\" data-name=\"Магазин / Б-2В-83\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[50px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[15px] top-[443px] w-[200px]\" data-node-id=\"407:516\">\n        Б-2В-83\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[319px] size-[19px] top-[443px]\" data-node-id=\"407:517\" data-name=\"Выбор / Б-2В-83\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img283} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-white h-[56px] left-[30px] rounded-[6px] top-[491px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:518\" data-name=\"Магазин / Б-2В-84\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[50px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[15px] top-[509px] w-[200px]\" data-node-id=\"407:519\">\n        Б-2В-84\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[319px] size-[19px] top-[509px]\" data-node-id=\"407:520\" data-name=\"Выбор / Б-2В-84\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img283} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#48352d] h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[24px] top-[585px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:606\" data-name=\"Основная кнопка / перенести товары\" />\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[16px] text-center text-white top-[599px] w-[310px]\" data-node-id=\"407:607\">\n        перенести товары\n      </p>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[24px] top-[585px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"407:608\" data-name=\"PROTO / перенести товары\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[#7d7d7d] text-[13px] top-[115px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"412:541\">\n        Товары будут убраны из исходного магазина и перемещены в выбранный. В остальных магазинах они останутся без изменений.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: white: #FFFFFF, gray 4: #7D7D7D, beige: #F0EFEB."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
